    "startS": 107.6,
    "endS": 119.7,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "I think that was like the main theme was creativity involves, um, being kind to yourself, which I don't think is Talked about as much as it should be.",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
